license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ciprian-LocalPulse/Entropic-Threat-Continuum"
abstract: >
  A research repository implementing the Entropic Threat Continuum and related
  constructs introduced in From Cipher to Shadow, including computational models
  for adversarial entropy, trust decay, threat-surface integration, anonymity
  stack analysis, and Dark Topology Conjecture simulation.
keywords:
  - information security
  - cybersecurity theory
  - cryptography
  - anonymity networks
  - threat modeling
  - privacy engineering
  - graph theory
  - adversarial systems
